# Apple passbook credentials live here (gitignored):
#   passbook.p12   — Pass Type ID certificate + private key (exported from
#                    Apple Developer > Certificates, IDs & Profiles).
#   wwdr.pem       — Apple Worldwide Developer Relations Relation cert
#                    (https://www.apple.com/certificateauthority/).
# Configure paths via PASSBOOK_CERT_PATH / PASSBOOK_WWDR_PATH env.
#
# Until these are present (Apple Developer Program enrollment — plan Open
# Question #8), the container resolves the wallet service to FakeWalletService
# so no unsigned .pkpass is ever served.
